<%-include('partials/header',{activepage:'',title:'shipping-returns',cartcount:cartcount})%>

    <!--shipping section-->
    <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <h4 class="mb-3"><i class="bi bi-truck me-2"></i>Shipping</h4>
        <p><strong>Delivery time</strong><br>
        Orders within major cities (Lahore, Karachi, Islamabad, Rawalpindi) typically arrive within 2-3 business days. Other cities may take 4-6 business days depending on courier service in your area.</p>

        <p><strong>Shipping charges</strong><br>
        Free shipping on all orders over Rs. 5,000. A flat rate of Rs. 250 applies to orders below that amount.</p>

        <p><strong>Order tracking</strong><br>
        Once your order is dispatched, you'll receive a tracking number via SMS or email so you can follow your package until it arrives.</p>

        <p><strong>Cash on Delivery</strong><br>
        COD is available across Pakistan. You can also pay online via bank transfer or card at checkout.</p>
      </div>

      <!--returns section-->
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <h4 class="mb-3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-return-left me-2"></i>Returns & Exchanges</h4>
        <p><strong>Return window</strong><br>
        If you receive a damaged, incorrect, or defective product, you can request a return or exchange within 3 days of delivery.</p>

        <p><strong>Condition for returns</strong><br>
        Items must be unused, unopened, and returned in their original packaging with all seals intact. Perfumes that have been opened or used cannot be returned due to hygiene reasons, unless the product itself was faulty.</p>

        <p><strong>How to request a return</strong><br>
        Contact our support team with your order number and a photo of the issue. Once approved, we'll arrange a pickup or guide you on how to send the item back.</p>

        <p><strong>Refunds</strong><br>
        Approved refunds are processed within 5-7 business days, either back to your original payment method or as store credit, based on your preference.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

 <%-include(`partials/footer`)%>

  </div>

